<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Seller Account Approved</title>
    <style>
        @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Outfit:wght@400;600;800&display=swap');
        
        body {
            font-family: 'Outfit', 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif;
            line-height: 1.7;
            color: #1e293b;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            background-color: #f1f5f9;
        }
        .wrapper {
            width: 100%;
            table-layout: fixed;
            background-color: #f1f5f9;
            padding-bottom: 40px;
        }
        .container {
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            background: #ffffff;
            border-radius: 32px;
            overflow: hidden;
            margin-top: 40px;
            box-shadow: 0 20px 25px -5px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1), 0 10px 10px -5px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.04);
        }
        .header {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #10b981 0%, #059669 100%);
            padding: 60px 40px;
            text-align: center;
            color: white;
            position: relative;
        }
        .header-bg-accent {
            position: absolute;
            top: -20px;
            right: -20px;
            width: 150px;
            height: 150px;
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
            border-radius: 50%;
        }
        .logo {
            font-size: 28px;
            font-weight: 800;
            letter-spacing: -1px;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            display: block;
        }
        .logo span {
            color: #a7f3d0;
        }
        .content {
            padding: 50px 40px;
            background-color: #ffffff;
        }
        .footer {
            background: #f8fafc;
            padding: 40px;
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 13px;
            color: #94a3b8;
            border-top: 1px solid #f1f5f9;
        }
        .button {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 16px 32px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #10b981 0%, #059669 100%);
            color: #ffffff !important;
            text-decoration: none;
            border-radius: 16px;
            font-weight: 700;
            margin-top: 30px;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 15px -3px rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.3);
        }
        h1 { margin: 0; font-weight: 800; font-size: 32px; }
        .greeting { font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; color: #1e293b; margin-bottom: 15px; }
        .highlight { color: #059669; font-weight: 700; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="wrapper">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="header">
                <div class="header-bg-accent"></div>
                
                                <!-- Premium CSS Logo -->
                <div style="margin-bottom: 25px; text-align: center;">
                    <div style="display: inline-block; width: 72px; height: 72px; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15); border: 2px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.4); border-radius: 20px; box-shadow: 0 8px 32px rgba(0,0,0,0.15); position: relative; text-align: center; line-height: 72px;">
                        <span style="font-size: 38px; vertical-align: middle;">🛍️</span>
                        <div style="position: absolute; top: -4px; right: -4px; width: 14px; height: 14px; background: #fbbf24; border-radius: 50%; box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(251, 191, 36, 0.8);"></div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div style="font-size: 36px; font-weight: 900; letter-spacing: -1.5px; color: #ffffff; font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif; margin-bottom: 15px; text-align: center;">
                    Micro<span style="color: #a5b4fc;">Cart</span><span style="color: #fbbf24;">.</span>
                </div>
                <h1>Congratulations! 🎉</h1>
                <p style="margin-top: 10px; font-weight: 600; opacity: 0.9;">Your Seller Account is Approved</p>
            </div>
            <div class="content">
                <p class="greeting">Hi {{name}},</p>
                <p>Great news! Our team has reviewed your application and verified your documents. Your store is now <span class="highlight">OFFICIALLY ACTIVE</span> on MicroCart.</p>
                <p>You can now start listing your products, managing your inventory, and reaching customers worldwide. We're excited to see your business grow with us!</p>
                <center>
                    <a href="http://localhost:3000/seller/dashboard" class="button">Go to Seller Dashboard</a>
                </center>
            </div>
            <div class="footer">
                <p>&copy; 2026 MicroCart Seller Central. All rights reserved.</p>
                <p>Success is just a product launch away!</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
